  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b201abe25cebddba89686adfbadd3afa0b72eb4b.png\" alt=\"標誌\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://count.getloli.com/@:Spartan-Weaponry?name=:Spartan-Weaponry&theme=minecraft&padding=7&offset=0&align=top&scale=1&pixelated=1&darkmode=auto\" alt=\":Spartan-Weaponry\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ASVG5n5xAg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1356601495289729034?label=Discord&logo=discord&color=7289DA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.mai-xiyu.top%252fen%252fspartan_weaponry_unofficial%252fintro%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Wiki-Spartan_Weaponry_Unofficial-2980b9?style=flat-square&logo=Wikipedia\" alt=\"維基\"></a></p>\n<h1>⚔️ Spartan Weaponry Unofficial (NeoForge)</h1>\n<p><strong>《<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry</a》的社群非官方移植版，適用於 Minecraft 1.21.1。</strong></p>\n<p>由於原作者（ObliviousSp）已超過六個月未活躍，本專案將原始程式碼移植至<strong>NeoForge 1.21.1</strong>，讓玩家能在最新版本中體驗豐富的斯巴達武器庫。</p>\n<h2>✨ 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>龐大武器庫：</strong>新增多種武器，包括長柄武器、鈍器、重劍以及遠程武器（長弓、十字弩、飛刀）。</li>\n<li><strong>獨特機制：</strong>武器具備自訂屬性，例如破甲、橫掃攻擊與多樣的攻擊速度。</li>\n<li><strong>材質支援：</strong>完整相容原版材質與常見模組礦物（銅、錫、青銅、鋼等）。</li>\n<li><strong>現代化重構：</strong>專為<strong>1.21.1</strong>版本的<strong>NeoForge</strong>生態系重新建構。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🛠️ 需求與相容性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>平台：</strong>NeoForge 1.21.1</li>\n<li><strong>推薦模組：</strong>* <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcurios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API</a>（用於箭袋欄位）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a>（用於查看合成配方）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>📜 致謝與授權</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原作者：</strong><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.curseforge.com/members/oblivioussp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ObliviousSp</a></li>\n<li><strong>移植者：</strong>Mai_xiyu 與 Claude AI</li>\n<li><strong>授權條款：</strong>Apache-2.0</li>\n</ul>\n<p>⚠️ <strong>注意：</strong>這是一個<strong>非官方</strong>分支。請在此專案頁面回報問題，<strong>不要</strong>回報至原作者的頁面。</p>",
